{"t":"Muglex Clan Camp","s":"muglex-clan-camp-e89d7","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Muglex_Clan_Footman_0bbf16.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Muglex Clan Camp</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Muglex Clan Footman\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Muglex_Clan_Footman_0bbf16.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Northwestern area of Newhaven, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32526,32430,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32526, 32430, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe Muglex Camp is a fortified goblin settlement located in the northwestern region of <a href=\"#/wiki/Newhaven\">Newhaven</a>. It is occupied by members of the Muglex Clan, a group of goblins that has arrived in Newhaven by ship and has been terrorizing the human village to the south for quite some time. The camp provides the clan with a fortified position from which they can launch attacks on the village.<br/>\nThe camp is intended for young adventurers. The Muglex Clan is the first threat that adventurers are asked to deal with.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Muglex%20Clan%20Footman\"><img alt=\"Muglex Clan Footman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"31\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Muglex_Clan_Footman_0bbf16.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Muglex%20Clan%20Footman\">Muglex Clan Footman</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">24</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-14× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Axe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-14× Simple Arrow (very rare)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Ranger's Cloak (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Legs\">Brass Legs</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spellbook\">Spellbook</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Plain Monk Robe (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-defa